  "summary": "Malicious code in chromeos-webdriver-cli (npm)",
  "details": "The postinstall hook of chromeos-webdriver-cli@1.0.0 runs automatically on install. It collects host metadata (hostname, platform, architecture, Node.js version, npm lifecycle event) and POSTs it as JSON over HTTPS to kvpq6u62[.]instances[.]poc[.]jchunt[.]top at path /chromeos-webdriver-cli. The beacon fires on every install without user interaction.",
